This is a '''list of quotes by {{ai|Reyna}}'''. Reyna is voiced by Karina Altamirano in English. Necessary quotes translated are from Spanish to English, unless otherwise stated. Reyna has two versions of her quotes; her standard set, and Empress set for when she is empowered by {{abi text|Empress}} with the latter having a filter applied to them. The standard set contains {{PAGESINCATEGORY:Reyna Quotes}} files of quotes and the Empress set contains {{PAGESINCATEGORY:Reyna Empress Quotes}} files of quotes, giving Reyna a grand total of {{#expr: {{PAGESINCATEGORY:Reyna Quotes}} + {{PAGESINCATEGORY:Reyna Empress Quotes}}}} files of quotes including unused and removed lines, and excluding [[#The Range's lore assets|The Range's lore assets]].

A downloadable folder containing all the audio files on this page can be found [https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1tAVPVmtpjDeZmbI8ZDQKPsMg3wssBvbk?usp=sharing here]. For quotes during Empress, see [[Reyna/Quotes/Empress]].

